#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: paycrypto-me-for-woocommerce.php
msgid "PayCrypto.Me for WooCommerce"
msgstr "PayCrypto.Me für WooCommerce"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: paycrypto-me-for-woocommerce.php
msgid "https://paycrypto.me/woocommerce/"
msgstr "https://paycrypto.me/woocommerce/"

#. Description of the plugin
#: paycrypto-me-for-woocommerce.php
msgid ""
"PayCrypto.Me for WooCommerce lets your store accept Bitcoin payments — On-"
"Chain and Lightning Network — directly into wallets and nodes you control."
msgstr ""
"PayCrypto.Me für WooCommerce ermöglicht es deinem Shop, Bitcoin-Zahlungen – "
"On-Chain und Lightning Network – direkt in Geldbörsen und Knoten zu "
"akzeptieren, die du kontrollierst."

